{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 工具调用与MCP MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"MCP 与 Function Calling 的区别和关系\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"工具调用与MCP\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> fundamental\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/工具调用\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/fundamental</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/04-%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">工具调用与MCP MOC</a></p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">MCP 和 Function Calling 有什么区别？有了 MCP 还需要 Function Calling 吗？</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">这是面试中最容易混淆也最高频的问题。MCP 和 Function Calling 不是竞争关系，而是<strong>不同层面、协作配合</strong>的关系。</p>\n<h3 data-heading=\"核心区别\" dir=\"auto\">核心区别</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Function Calling</th>\n<th>MCP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>本质</strong></td>\n<td>模型的一种原生能力</td>\n<td>一套通信协议标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>关注点</strong></td>\n<td>模型如何表达\"我要调用工具\"</td>\n<td>工具如何被标准化暴露给 AI 应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>层面</strong></td>\n<td>模型调用层</td>\n<td>应用接入层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>谁实现</strong></td>\n<td>模型提供商（OpenAI、Anthropic 等）</td>\n<td>开发者搭建 Server，Host 连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>作用范围</strong></td>\n<td>模型 ↔ 调用方之间</td>\n<td>AI 应用 ↔ 外部工具之间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>类比</strong></td>\n<td>你会\"打电话\"这个技能</td>\n<td>约定用\"普通话\"交流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-heading=\"一句话概括\" dir=\"auto\">一句话概括</h3>\n<blockquote dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>Function Calling 是\"决策层\"，MCP 是\"通信层\"。</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">Function Calling：模型说\"我要调用 get_weather，参数是 city='北京'\"</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">MCP：标准化地把 get_weather 这个能力从 Server 暴露给 Host，让任何 AI 应用都能发现和使用</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-heading=\"协作关系\" dir=\"auto\">协作关系</h3>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">用户提问\n    ↓\nAI 模型使用 Function Calling 能力 → 决定调用哪个工具、生成参数\n    ↓\nMCP Client 将调用转换为 MCP 协议格式\n    ↓\nMCP Server 接收请求，执行实际操作（查数据库、调 API 等）\n    ↓\n结果通过 MCP 返回给模型\n    ↓\n模型生成最终回答\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"形象比喻\" dir=\"auto\">形象比喻</h3>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Function Calling = 手</strong>（抓取工具的能力）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>MCP = 标准化的工具把手/接口</strong>（USB-C）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>A2A = 使用工具分工合作的团队</strong>（Agent 间协作）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-heading=\"实际系统中的配合方式\" dir=\"auto\">实际系统中的配合方式</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 实际系统的工作流程示例</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">agent_with_mcp</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>user_query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 1. MCP 发现工具（应用层）</span>\n    all_tools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> server <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> mcp_servers<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        tools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> server<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>list_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        all_tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>extend<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 2. 将 MCP 工具转换为 Function Calling Schema（格式转换层）</span>\n    function_schemas <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"function\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"function\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> t<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> t<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>description<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"parameters\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> t<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>inputSchema\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> t <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> all_tools\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 3. Function Calling：模型决策调用哪个工具（模型层）</span>\n    response <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>chat<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>completions<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>create<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n        messages<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"role\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"user\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> user_query<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        tools<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>function_schemas<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        tool_choice<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"auto\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token comment\"># 4. MCP 执行工具调用（通信层）</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> response<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>choices<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool_calls<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        tool_call <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> response<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>choices<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool_calls<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> mcp_client<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>call_tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>function<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>name<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            json<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>loads<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>tool_call<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>function<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>arguments<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 5. 结果返回模型，生成最终回答</span>\n        final <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>chat<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>completions<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>create<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            messages<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 包含工具结果</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> final<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>choices<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"OpenAI 官方对 MCP 的集成\" dir=\"auto\">OpenAI 官方对 MCP 的集成</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">OpenAI 在 Responses API 中直接支持 MCP Server 作为 <code class=\"code-styler-inline\">type: \"mcp\"</code> 的工具接入，说明业界趋势是将 MCP 作为工具来源，Function Calling 作为模型调用方式。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 没有 MCP 之前怎么接入工具？</strong><br>\nA: 开发者需要为每个工具手写桥接代码（胶水代码），每个 AI 应用都要单独适配每个工具。MCP 出现后，工具开发者实现一次 MCP Server，任何 MCP Host 都能自动发现和连接。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 三者层级关系 Function Calling / MCP / Skill 怎么理解？</strong><br>\nA: 从底到顶的三层架构：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">Function Calling（底层调用语言）→ MCP（工具标准化接入）→ Skill（流程模板封装）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">类比：FC 是手，MCP 是 USB 接口，Skill 是\"操作手册\"</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：MCP 出来以后 Function Calling 被淘汰了。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：MCP 底层仍然依赖 Function Calling 作为模型的调用机制，二者是互补关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：MCP 和 Function Calling 是同一层面的竞争方案。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：一个是协议层（MCP），一个是模型能力层（FC），解决的问题完全不同。</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>误区</strong>：用了 MCP 就不需要写工具代码了。<br>\n<strong>纠正</strong>：MCP 只解决连接和通信问题，工具的具体业务逻辑仍需开发者实现。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>","headings":[]}